@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.common.drops
@title Media loading — common file drops
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Common
@entry viewer-drop, window-drop
@summary Trace shared file-system drops, distinguishing list-backed intake from direct-viewer loading.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.list-add, functionality.media-loading.common.viewer, functionality.media-loading.merge
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag drag-drop

@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer
@alias window = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainWindow.PWindow

[viewer-drop] Viewer file drop <input>
- Receive a file-system drop on the viewer overlay and determine whether the viewer has a list-backed drop subscriber @ viewer.PDropHandle(...)
> viewer-drop-result

[window-drop] Window file drop <input>
- Receive a routed file-system drop outside a Merge group and inspect the currently active Files/viewer surfaces @ window.PDropHandle(...)
> window-drop-result

[viewer-drop-result] Viewer drop routing <decision>
- In list-backed mode require at least one folder or supported media path; otherwise require the first existing file and reject disallowed audio-only media @ viewer.PDropEffectRead(...)
- Forward accepted list-backed paths through PDropPathsChange, or request the accepted direct file through PViewerSourceOpen @ viewer.PDropHandle(...)
? "List-backed drop accepted" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-add
? "Direct viewer file accepted" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "Drop rejected" > viewer-drop-rejected

[window-drop-result] Window drop routing <decision>
- Ignore drops owned by a Merge group; in list-backed mode require a supported folder/media path, otherwise require an active viewer and first existing file allowed by the audio policy @ window.PDropHandle(...)
  @ window.PDropEffectRead(...)
- Forward accepted paths to the active Files list, or request the accepted direct file from the active viewer @ window.PDropHandle(...)
? "Active Files list accepts drop" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-add
? "Viewer-only surface accepts file" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "Drop rejected or no viewer" > window-drop-rejected

[viewer-drop-rejected] Viewer drop rejected <output>
= The drop starts neither shared Files intake nor a direct viewer load.

[window-drop-rejected] Window drop rejected <output>
= The routed drop starts neither shared Files intake nor a direct viewer load.
